MSG_WELCOME (//)
<html><head><title>HelpViewer</title></head><body><h1>HelpViewer</h1><p>Open a directory with help pages: <b>Project/Open Directory...</b></p><p>Its <tt>index.html</tt> is shown first; the tree on the left lists the pages by their titles.</p></body></html>
